13. The Kubernetes Operator
The pastaay Kubernetes operator manages chaos policies as Custom Resources. When you apply a ChaosPolicy
CRD to your cluster, the operator detects it, translates it into the engine's configuration format, and pushes it to the target pods through the webhook API:
apiVersion: chaos.pastaay.io/v1
kind: ChaosPolicy
metadata:
name: payment-service-stress
spec:
policies:
- name: http-latency-spike
type: http
target: /api/payments/*
latency_chance: 0.8
latency_duration: 3s
- name: db-connection-drop
type: sql
target: database
drop_connection: true
error_chance: 0.3
The operator controller watches for CRD changes and reconciles the desired state against the engine. It also handles the RBAC necessary for the log streaming feature, a separate ClusterRole that grants pod log read access.
